tory` by username.\n\n- **User/roles model**\n  - `demos-coghealth-ehr-api/src/main/java/com/medchart/ehr/domain/auth/User.java`\n  - Implements `UserDetails`.\n  - Roles are:\n    - `PROVIDER`\n    - `ADMIN`\n    - `STAFF`\n  - Authorities are exposed as `ROLE_PROVIDER`, `ROLE_ADMIN`, etc.\n\n- **Frontend API auth header**\n  - `demos-coghealth-ehr-api/frontend/src/api/client.ts`\n  - Adds `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `localStorage.auth_token`.\n  - Redirects to `/login` on `401`.\n\n# Summary\n\nAuth is centered around the API module\u2019s Spring Security/JWT files under:\n\n```text\ndemos-coghealth-ehr-api/src/main/java/com/medchart/ehr/\n```\n\nThe key files are `SecurityConfig.java`, `AuthController.java`, `JwtTokenProvider.java`, `JwtAuthenticationFilter.java`, `CustomUserDetailsService.java`, and `domain/auth/User.java`."
